<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Ephet</para>
  <para style="toc1">EPHETEA veia Pawluha Cayuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephet</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eph</para>
  <para style="mt1">EPHETEA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Veia Pawluha Cayuk</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">Ephetea vei Pawluha ca yuk hin akcüka “Pamhnama nümnak üng mhnünmceng naküt atänga law lü khankhaw ja mcea veki naküta lua Khritaw cun kyaki” ti üng sängeiki ni (1.10). Jesuh Khritaw üng khyangmjü yümmat lü Pamhnama nümnak üng khyange ami xünsei vaia a jah nghuinaka pi kyaki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ephet caupa ma da ta, ca yuki naw Pa Pamhnam naw a khyange a jah xüa tuilam üngkhyüh yümmatnaka mawng cun a mdäm law, Cakpa Jesuh Khritaw naw ihawkba ami mkhyenak üngkhyüh a jah mhlät ja nawnei ja ihawkba Pamhnama dämduhkia khyütam naw Ngmüimkhya Ngcim üngkhyüh ngsingnak a jah pet ti cun ngpüiki. Anghngihnak ta ca khekie cun Khritaw am ami yümmatnak üng ami xüngsei hin ami ngneisak üngpi a ve law vaia phäha ni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pamhnama khyange Khritaw am ami yümmatnak cun Msuimcäpnak khawhah sumeiki: Sangcim cun pumsaa mäi law lü Khritaw cun a lu, am ani üng imloa mäi law lü Khritaw cun kittunga lung, am ani üng, nghnumia mäi law lü Khritaw cun kpamia kba a mtumtäng ni. Khritaw üng Pamhnama bäkhäknak naw cayuki kpüi lü akhlüng kunga ngthu am pyenki ni. Anaküt cun Khritawa mhläkphyanak akvai, amät petmsawtnak, mhläteinak, bäkhäknak ja ngcimngcaihnake üng hmu päihki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khritaw ja Sangcim <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3—3:21</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khritaw üng sak kthai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1—6:20</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akpäihnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Ngs 18:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref></char>
    </note>Khritawa ngsä vaia Pamhnam naw a xü Pawluh üngkhyüh ni —</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">avanga caup üng am ve</char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Ephet.</char>
    </note>Sitih lü Khritaw Jesuha hnu läkie Epheta veki Pamhnama khyange veia ni.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Mi Pa Pamhnam ja Bawi Jesuh Khritaw naw ami bäkhäknak ja dim’yenak ning jah pe se.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritaw üng Ngmüimkhya dawkyanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Pamhnam ja Mi Bawi Jesuh Khritawa Pamhnam veia jenak mi mtheh vai u! Khritaw üng mi yüm mata phäh ani naw khankhaw pea ka Ngmüimkhya dawnak naküt mimi üng jah pe lü dawkyanak pi jah peki. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Pamhnam naw khawmdek am a mhnünmceng ham üng mimi cun Khritaw üng xüngsei lü ania hmai maa ngcimcaih lü vecawh vaia a jah xü ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Isetiakyaküng a mhläkphyanaka phäh ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Pamhnam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pamhnam maa. Pamhnama kphyanaka phäha; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ania maa, kphyanak am xün vai. Pamhnam.</char></note> cun naw Jesuh Khritaw üngkhyüh a jah ca vaia a mkhyah päng ni, ahin cun ania xenak ja bünaka kyaki ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>A mhläkphyanaka Cakpa amdanga a jah peta phäh jomahkia a bäkhäknak mi mhlünmtai vai u. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kol 1:14</ref></char></note>Khritawa thia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritawa thi üngkhyüh</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritaw ajüa a thihnak.</char></note> phäh lätnak mi yahki acun cun mi mkhye mhlätnak ni. Pamhnama bäkhäknak hin däm da ve. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Acuna bäkhäknak am a mät naw ksingnak ja themnak jah peki. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Pamhnam naw i nüm’yanki ti cun pawh lü ngthupki a bü cun Khritaw üngkhyüh kümcei khaia a mkhyah päng cun jah ksingsaki. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Ahina bünak cun akcün a pha law üng a küm law käna mce ja khankhawa veki naküt avan Khritaw lua kya lü ania kea jah ta law khai.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Anaküt cun Pamhnama nümyan ja a titänga ve lü Pamhnam naw a khyanga kya lü Khritaw am mi yümmat khaia jah xü hin akcük üngkhyüh ania bünak am a mkhyah päng ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Khritaw mi na äpei makia mimia phäha, Pamhnama hlüngtainak mi mküimto vaia phäha kyaki.<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Nangmi pi ngthu kcang, Thangkdaw nami ngjak naw küikyannak da ning jah lawpüi lü Pamhnama khyanga nami kyaki. Khritaw nami jumei ja Pamhnam naw a ning jah ka tia msingnak cun a ning jah bekhütnaka Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ning jah peki ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Pamhnam naw a khyange khyütam a jah peta kba mimi naw Ngmüimkhya Ngcim mi yahkie, acun cun Pamhnam naw a jah kümbekia mhlät cun jah ksingsaki. Pamhnam naw mküinak yah se.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluha ktaiyünak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Acunakyase, Bawi Jesuh nami jum ja khyang ngcime nami ja mhlänak ka ngjak üng, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>nangmia phäha a bäkhäknak anglät se mhlünmtai lü ka ktaiyü üngpi ning jah süm ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Ka ktaiyünak ta mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa Pamhnam, jomahkia Pamhnam naw Ngmüikhya ning jah pe lü acuna Ngmüimkhya naw kthemnak ja amät ksingnak a ning jah pet vaia ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Akvai nami hmuhnak thei vaia nami mlunga nghmawngnak vai Pamhnama veia ka ktaiyüki. A ning jah khünak üng äpeinak i ti cun nami ksingnak vai ja a khyange üng khyütam a jah pet ihlawka müncam phyakia dawkyanak daki ni, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>ani mi jumeikia khana a johita khut bi cun ihlawka dämduhki ni. Mi khana khut bikia johit cun ktha mah säihki ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sal 110:1</ref></char></note> Acun cun Khritaw thinak üngkhyüh mtho be lü khankhaw pea a khet lama a ngawhsak, <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Khritaw naw ngvaie, khankhawa anataknake, johite, bawie naküt, hina khawmdek khan däka am kya velaw khaia khana pi jah upkia kyaki ni. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Sal 8:6</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22,23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1:18</ref></char></note>Acunüng Pamhnam naw anaküt, ania khaw kea a tak, anaküta khana lua kya khaia sangcim üng a pet, <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>acun cun ania mtisaa kya lü ani üng kümceiki cun anaküt kümceisaki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">amät naw hnün naküta a kümsak</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pamhnama bebangnak am amät küm beki.</char></note><verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Thihnak üngkhyüh xünnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:13">Kol 2:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ahlana nangmi cun Ngmüimkhya lama nami thiki, isetiakyaküng, pyen käh ngja lü nami mkhyekata phäh ni. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Acuna kcün üng am dawkia khawmdeka lam kse läk lü khawlivaa veki ngmüimkhya johitea uknak nami jah kcangnaki. Acuna Ngmüimkhya naw Pamhnam käh kcangnak vaia khyange cun atuha jah pinmanki. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Mimi pi amimi akba ve khawi lü ni mtisa hlüeia mimäta pumsae ja mlungkawea titänga mi xüng khawikie. Mi mtisa lama avana kba Pamhnama mlungsonak mi khamei khaiea mi ngkawihkie ni.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Lüpi Pamhnama a jah mpyeneinak nungmja lü a jah kphyanak pi dämduhki, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>pyen käh ngja lü Ngmüimkhya lama mkhyea phäh mi thih k'um üng ani naw Khritaw am xünnaka a jah lawpüi ni. Pamhnama bäkhäknak am küikyannak nami yahki. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Khritaw Jesuh üng mi yümmatnak am ani naw jah mtho be lü ani am khankhaw pea atänga mi uk khai. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Ahin a pawh cun law khai akcün tä üng mdan lü aktäa dämduhkia a bäkhäknak cun Khritaw Jesuh üng a kphyanak jah mdanki. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8-9"/>Pamhnama bäkhäknak üng jumnak üngkhyüh küikyannak nami yahki. Ahin cun namimäta mtunkthaeinak am kya, lüpi Pamhnam naw ajüa aning jah yet ni, acuna kyase u pi käh camcah kawm.<verse eid="EPH 2:8-9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Mimi cun Pamhnama sepbeia mi kya lü Pamhnam naw Khritaw Jesuh üng yümmat lü akdaw mi pawh khaia a jah mhnünmceng päng ni, mi bilawh vai kunga a jah pitpyang pet päng ni.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritaw üng pumsa mat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Nami ngtüi law üng khyangmjükcee, Judahe naw “vun am mawiki” aning jah tinak, amimäte naw ta vun mawikia ngsuikiea (Ahin cun khyang naw pumsa üng bilawhnak) ajana ihawkba nami ve khawiki ti cun süm ua. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Acuna kcün üng Khritaw üngkhyüh nami thuki. Nangmi cun khyangmjükcea kya lü Pamhnama a jah xü khyanga pi am kya uki. Pamhnam naw Isarele üng khyütam a jah pet ngthupet üng pi am sängei lü Pamhnam jah äpeinak käh ta lü khawmdeka nami xüng khawiki. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Tuh ta, ajana thuk khawi uki lüpi Khritawa thisen naw ning jah law püi lü Khritaw Jesuh üng nami yümmat law beki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritawa thisen; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritaw ajüa thinak.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Khritaw amät naw dim’yenak law püi lü Judahe ja khyangmjükcee cun khyangmjü mata a jah pyan. Yea jah thawnsaki ja jah mkhyakia kpang cun amäta pumsa üng a kcimpyak ni. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Kol 2:14</ref></char></note>Ani naw Judahea Thum, ngthupet ja ningsawe jah kpyakki, isetiakyaküng, khyangmjü nghngih cun khyang kthai mata kya lü a nih üng a jah yümmatsak. Ahikba va dimdeihnak a bi law. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Ani kutlamtunga a thiha phäh üng am ami ngkhawtnak mkhyüh lü kutlamtunga phäh üng khyangmjü nghngih cun pumsa mat üng jah ngkhawsak lü Pamhnama vei a jah law püi be. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Hesa 57:19</ref></char></note>Acuna kyase Khritaw cun law lü dimdeihnaka Thangkdaw cun ami vana vei — Pamhnam am thuki khyangmjükce ja Pamhnam am cähki Judahe vei sangki. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Khritaw üngkhyüh khyangmjükce jah Judah mi van cun Ngmüimkhya mat am Pa Pamhnama maa mi law khawhki.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Acuna kyase, nangmi khyangmjükcee cun pe kce khyanga ja khina am kya ti u ki, nangmi cun Pamhnama khyange am atänga khankhaw khyanga thawn u lü Pamhnama canaa nami kyaki. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Khritaw Jesuh amät cun <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ngsä he ja sahmae naw tüneinaka khana ami mdüi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">tüneinak acun hin ngsä he ja sahmae.</char></note>tüneinak lunga kya lü nangmi cun tüneinaka khana ngsä he ja sahmae naw aning jah sawngsak ua kyaki. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Ani naw im avan cun kcüng lü Pamhnam üng pet vaia dawki temple ngcima dämduhsak lü Bawipa üng a ap ni. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Ani üng yümmat lü Pamhnam cun a Ngmüimkhya üng a ve vaia nangmi cun khyang kcee am atänga ning jah sawngsaka nami kyaki.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Khyangmjükcee phäh Pawluha khut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Ahina phäh, nangmi khyangmjükceea phäha Khritaw Jesuha thawng khyuma ka kyaki kei Pawluh Pamhnama veia ka ktaiyüki. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Nami phäha akdaw ka pawh vaia Pamhnam naw a bäkhäknak a na pet tia nami ksing pängki. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Pamhnam naw ngthupkia a mkhüh cun na mdan lü na ksingsaki. (Kei naw ahina mawng cun aktawia ka yuk pängki, <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26">Kol 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="COL 1:27">27</ref></char></note>i ka yuk law ti cun nami kheh ua kyak üng ngthupkia Khritawa mawng ka ksingnak cun nami ngtheinak khaie.) <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Ahlana kcün üng ta ahina ngthupki cun nghngicime üng am jah mtheh, lüpi, atuh ta Pamhnam naw Ngmüimkhya sumei lü ngsä ngcime ja sahmae üng jah mdanki. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Ngthupki tinak cun thangkdaw üngkhyüh khyangmjükcee naw Pamhnama dawkyanak cun Judahe mah maha yahkie. Pumsa mata kya u lü Pamhnam naw Khritaw Jesuh üngkhyüh a pawha khyütam cun pi yah hnga kie.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Kei cun Pamhnama bäkhäknak üng thangkdawa phäh mpyaa ka kyaki. Acun cun a johit üngkhyüh khut binak vaia ani naw kei üng a na pet ni. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Kei cun Pamhnama khyang kneme kthaka pi ka nem säihki, lüpi am päih khawhkia Khritawa bawimangnaka mawng Thangkdaw cun khyangmjükcee vei cehpüi khaia hina kcün kdaw a na pet kya lü, <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Pamhnama ngthupkia mkhüh cun khyang avan naw a mi hmuh vaia kyaki. Pamhnam cun avan tüipyang lü ajana kcün üng ngthupki a na cümki, <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>atuha kcün üng ta Pamhnam naw sangcim üngkhyüh khankhawngsä hea uknak ja khankhawa veki johite cun naw ania pumngyam cun hngalangkia pumngyam mjüküm üng ngthei na khaie ni. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Pamhnam naw ania angläta atitänga kba pawhki, acun cun mi Bawipa Khritaw Jesuh üngkhyüh a yah ni. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Khritaw am yümmat lü Ani mi jumnak üngkhyüh mkhühüpnak am Pamhnama hmai maa ling lü mi citcawnki. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Käh pukse ua ti lü ning jah nghui na veng, isetiakyaküng, nangmia phäh khuikha ka khamei hin nami dawnak vaia phäh ni.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritawa mhläkphyanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Ahina phäha Pa Pamhnama vei ka mkhuk msüm veng, <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>khawmdek ja khankhaw üng veki khuiim kyawnglawng naküt naw ngming kcang cun ani üngkhyüh a yah. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Kei naw Pamhnam ka kthäh ta hlüngtaikia a khawhthema naw Ngmüimkhya üngkhyüh johit ning jah pe lü nami uma ka angkhängsak vaia ni. <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>Jumeinak üngkhyüh Khritaw naw nami mlung k'uma a imlo a sak vaia ka ktaiyüki. Mhläkphyanak üng tünei lü Mhläkphyanak am nami ngphungmanei vaia ka ktaiyüki. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Acun üngva nangmi cun Pamhnama khyange am atänga Khritawa mhläkphyanak ihlawka thuk lü hlüngki, ihlawka saü lü jaüki tia nami ksinga johit nami tak khai. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Ä, Khritawa mhläkphyanak cun nami ksing khai lüpi kümbe khaia am mi ksing khawh, acuna kyase, Pamhnama ning üng bebang ua.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Mi cungaiha kthaka am ani üng mi kthähkhyah khawia kthaka sa lü johit am mi k'uma khut bi khawhki cun Pamhnama kyaki. <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Akcün tä se, Khritaw Jesuh üngkhyüh sangcim khana Pamhnama hlüngtainak angläta ve se! Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Khritaw üng yümmatnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Bawipa khut ka pawha phäh thawng üng ka kyumki kei naw ka ning jah nghuinak ta, Pamhnam naw a ning jah khü üng a ning jah tak pet cän nami kpha vaia xüngsei ua. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12">Kol 3:12</ref>,<ref loc="COL 3:13">13</ref></char></note> Angläta mlung mhnem lü hniphnawi lü mlung msaü lü ve ua. Mat ja mat püi cuneinak am nami mhläkphyanak mdan ua. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Dim’yenak am atänga ning jah khitkhawn khaia Ngmüimkhya naw a ning jah peta yümmatnak cän nami khyaih khawha thupei ua. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Pumsa mat ja Ngmüimkhya mat ni a ve ta, Pamhnam naw a ning jah khü üng pi äpeinak mat ni a ve. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Bawipa mat, jumnak mat, baptican mat ja, <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>khyang avana Pa ja Pamhnam mat ni a ve. Ani cun avan khana Bawia kya lü avana üngkhyüh khut bi lü avana k'uma veki.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Khritaw naw aphäh phäha a jah pet ktunga letsawng cun mat cim naw mi yahki. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Cangcim naw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Ak’hlünga a kai üng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">tamna khawhah a jah cehpüi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">khyange üng letsawng pi jah peki,” a ti.<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Atuha “kaiki” tinak hin i ni? Tinak hlü ta a ni cun akcüka aknem säiha khawmdeka kyum lawki ni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aknem säiha khawmdeka; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">anemnak, mdek kunga.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Kyum lawki cun jäng kaiki kunga kya lü khankhawea khan ja acuna thea üng pi a venak cun khawliva avan üng beki ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Ani cun naw “khyange üng letsawnge jah peki”; ani naw avang cun ngsä he vaia a jah mcawn, akcee cun sahmae vaia, akcee cun evawnkelih saja vaia, akcee cun pasatae jah mtheimthangkiea a jah mcawna kyaki. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Khritawa pumsa cun sawngsak vaia phäha Pamhnama khyange cun khritjan kawnsang khut üng ngpüi khaia a jah pitpyang ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Mi jumnak yümmatnaka k'um ja Pamhnam ksingnaka atänga mi lawki. Mimi cun xüngvai law lü Khritawa hlüngkia a pumyaw cun mi pha vaia ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Khyange jah mhlei lü hlawhlepnak mtünmdawng u lü hmakatnaka jah cehpüikie khyangea mtheinak naw a jah jawnceh canaea mimi cun am ni kya ti u. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Acuna hnün üng lua kyaki Khritaw üng dämduh lü mhläkphyanaka Ngmüimkhya am ngthungtak cun mi pyen yah khai. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kol 2:19</ref></char></note>Ania upthingnaka nghngalangkia kphyeme cun atänga pumsa mat am ve u lü pumsa mat naw kphyem avan cun atänga jah mcahki. Mat cim naw a mi pawh vai pawh u lü pumsa cun mhläkphyanak am däm law lü amät cun sawngsaeiki.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritaw üng sak kthai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Pamhnam am tä lü ami cungaih pi ia am ngtähkhehki khyangea kba msu lü käh nami xün vaia Bawipa ngming ning jah mcäi lü, <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Acuna khyange mlung cun nghmüp k'uma ni. Pamhnam naw a jah peta xünnak üng am ngpüi u, ami cun mawngcei lü ami mlung pi ngcangki. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Ami ngkeei vai am ksing lü mtüihmlehki ja akse bilawhnak naküt üng am ngphep khawh u lü amimät ngapeikie ni.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Khritawa vei ami ngthei ta acun am ni! <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>A mawng nami ngjaki, nami cun a hnu kläkea ami kya akba Jesuh üng veki ngthungtak cun nami ngtheikie ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Kol 3:9</ref></char></note>Acunakyase nami xünnak khawi, akphyüme cän jah hawihkceh lü akphyüm amät hin am dawkia hlükaweinak naw akpyak ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Nami mlung ja cungaihnak cun akthaia avan jah pyang u, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:10">Kol 3:10</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Gen 1:26</ref></char></note>lü akthai cän jah suisa u, acun hin Pamhnam am täng lü xünnak akcanga kyaki ngcim lü ngsungki tia amät naw mdan khaia mhnünmcenga kyaki ni.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zakh 8:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Käh hleihlak ti vai! Mat cim naw ngthungtak cun jumeiki akcee üng nami mtheh yah khai, isetiakyaküng, Khritawa pumsa üng mi van hin atänga akphyema mi kyaki. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Sal 4:4</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Nami mlung a so law üng mkhyenak käh pawhsak lü a mhnüpa nami mlung käh so kawm. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Khawyai üng akcün käh pe u. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Nami mpyukei khawi üng mpyukeinak cän hawih lü khut bi ua, iseniti ta mpyenkseki nami jah kpüinak vai ja nami phäha akdaw lama nami yahmtang thei vaia ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Khyükse käh sumei lü ngdüih thawhnak vai khyü däk sumei u. Akcukba ani üngva ngjakiea phäha na pyensak daw lü jah sawngsa khai ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya Ngcim käh thüiseisak ua, Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw va ning jah msing lü Pamhnam naw a ning jah mhlätnak vaia Mhnüpa phäh amahkhamkia kyaki. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Mlungsonak, mlungsetnak ja am dawki hlükaweinak cun jah hawih ua. Püi cawkeinak, ngpyangpyetnak ja ng’eihnak am ve ti. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Kol 3:13</ref></char></note>Acuna hnün üng mat ja mat üawm na lü Pamhnam naw Khritaw üngkhyüh aning jah mhläteia kba mat ja mat pi mhlätei ua.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Akvai üng xünnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Nangmi cun Pamhnama mhlänak caea nami kyaka phäh, ani üng nami täng vaia ktha na u. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Ex 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Sal 40:6</ref></char></note>Mhläkphyanak naw nami kcün sak up yah khai, Khritaw naw jah mhläkphya na lü a sak a jah pet cun Pamhnam jekyaisak lü ng’uinghnamkia petmsawt ja ngkengnaka a kyaka kba ni.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Pamhnama khyanga nami kyaka phäha hüipawmnak, kamvanak ja am ngjaphyakia vecawhnak cun nami ksunga käh pyen ua. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Am dawkyaki ja mdihmsuinaka ngthukhyüe cun pi nami phäha am daw ve. Acuna kcaha Pamhnam je na ua. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Nami ksing vai ta ngneisak am dawki, am ngjakphyakia vecawhnak ja kamvanak (Kammanak cun juktuh hjawkhahnaka ngkhaw ni) naw Pamhnam ja Khritawa pe cun u naw pi am yah uki.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>U naw pi käh ning jah nghmawng mhlei se, isetiakyaküng, Pamhnama mlungsonak cun ani am kcangnakiea khana pha law khai ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Acunakyase, acuna khyange am mi jah pawh püi vai am ve. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Nangmi cun mthana nami ve khawikie lüpi Bawipaa khyanga nami thawn pängkie kya lü akvai k'uma nami vekie. Acunakyase akvai kanaki khyange mäiha xüng ua, <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>akvai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akvai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang caupe üngta </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngmüimkhya ti lü veki</char></note> kyase, acun naw ngthungtak, dawkyanak ja ngsungpyunnak naw mawihaheinak be law püiki ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>I naw Bawipa jesaki i ti cun ktha na lü ngtheingthang ua. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Ia am kyahkia khyangea bilawh cän anghmüp üng sängeikie ni. Acuna hnün üng anghmüp üngkhyüh jah set lü akvai da jah law püi ua. (<verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Angthupnaka ami bilawhe jah pyen vaia pi ngkeeiphyaki ni.) <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Anaküt akvaia vei ni law püi üng, ami ngneisak kcang cun angsing ngdangki; <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Acunakyase, anaküt angsinga mdanki cun akvaia kyaki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Ipkia khyang let law,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">thinak üngkhyüh tho law,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">acunüng Khritaw na khana vai khai ni,” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anaküt angsinga mdanki cun akvaia kyaki</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akvai naw anaküt angsinga mdanki.</char></note>tia pyenki.<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Acunakyase, ihawkba na vecawhki mceieia. I am ksingkia mäia käh ve lü khyang kthemngvaia mäia vea. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kol 4:5</ref></char></note>Na taka kcün daw cun akdawa sumeia, isetiakyaküng, atuh cun am dawkia kcünmka ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Käh nghmawng ua, Bawipa naw i ning jah pawh hlüsaki ti cun ktha na lü sui ua. <verse eid="EPH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Ning jah kpyak khaia ju käh mpyüi lü acuna hnün üng Ngmüimkhya am be ua. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19,20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16">Kol 3:16</ref>,<ref loc="COL 3:17">17</ref></char></note>Mküinake, Salan ja ngcimkia ng’äie am mat ja mat mtheh ua; mküinake ja Salan jah mcuk lü nami mlungkyawng am Bawipa mküimto ua. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Pa Pamhnam veia anaküt cun mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa ngming üng anglät se jenak mtheh ua.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nghnumi ja Kpami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Khritaw nami leisawngnak am mat ja mat mlung mhnem ua.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Pit 3:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nghnumie Bawipa kea nami veia kba nami ceia kea pi ve ua. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Isetiakyaküng, Khritaw cun sangcima khana ana a vea kba kpami cun a nghnumia khana ana veki, Khritaw a mät cun amäta pumsaa kyaki sangcima küikyan Bawi ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Sangcim cun Khritawa kea a vea kba nghnumie pi ami ceiea kea ve u se.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Pit 3:7</ref></char>
    </note>Khritaw naw sangcim mhlä na lü a sak a peta kba kpamie naw pi nami khyu jah mhlä na ua. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Tui am ngcim khaia a jah pyawt käna a ngthu cun Pamhnam naw sangcim am a jah ap ni, <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>sangcim cun ngtongtai lü caih lü käh mkhye lü käh ngpihma lü käh ngkhep lü amät kümcei lü amät kung üng a pet vaia phäh ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Kpami he naw ami mäta pumsa ami kphyanaka kba ami khyue jah kphya na u se. A nghnumi kphyanakia kpami naw amät kphyanaki. (<verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Mi mäta pumsa am hmu hlüki u am ve. Khritaw naw sangcim a bühtenga kba mi pumsa cun mcei lü mi mbeimbawki ni; <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Mimi cun a pumsa üng mi ngpüiki.) <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Gen 2:24</ref></char></note> Cangcim naw, “Ahina phäha kpami naw a nu ja a pa jah hawih lü a khyu üng yümmat lü nghngih cun mata thawn khai,” tia pyenki. <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Ahin cun thuk lü ngthupkia ngthungtak cun Cangcim üng mdanki, acun kei naw ksing ngüse Khritaw ja sangcim am ka msuimcäpki. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Nangmi naw pi ahin sumei ua: kpami naküt naw ami mäta kba a khyu kphya na lü nghnumi naküt naw pi a kpami leisawng yah khai.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Nupae ja Hnasen he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:20">Kol 3:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hnasen he aw, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">caup avang üng am ve </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khritjan mta.</char></note>nami nupaa mtheh nami ngjak vai cun khritjan mtaa kya lü akcanga nami pawh vai kunga kyaki. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2,3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ex 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deut 5:16</ref></char></note>“Na nu ja na pa jah leisawnga” ti hin akcüka ngthupeta kya lü khyütam pi ngpüiki: <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>“Acunüng, nang cun akdawa citcawn lü na venak mdeka na sak pi saü khai ni.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:21">Kol 3:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nupae, nami cae ami mlung a sonak vaia käh jah pawh ua. Acuna hnün üng Khritjan thumning am jah mthehmkhyah lü jah jäksawn ua.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpyae ja Mahpae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5-8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Kol 3:22-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mpyae aw, Khritawa khut nami bikia kba mlungkyawng ngcim am bi lü nami nghngicim mahpaea pyen cän kyühkyawknak am jah kcang na u. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>A ning jah mküiei vaia a ning jah hmuh däk üng käh pawh lü Khritawa mpyaa kba Pamhnam naw i hlükaweiki ti cun mlungkyawng kcang am pawh ua. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Mpya khut nami pawh üng nghngicima khut pawhkia kba am kya lü Bawipa khut pawhkia kba jekyai lü khüia. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Mpya pi ni se, mpya am niki pi ni se, akdaw ni bilawh cun mat cima khana Bawipa naw jah thung be khai ti cun süma.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:1">Kol 4:1</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Deut 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Kol 3:25</ref></char>
    </note>Mahpae, nami mpyae nami jah mkyühmcik cän hawih lü akdawa ngneisak ua. Khyang naküt angteha ngthu jah mkhyah khai khankhawa ka Bawipa naw ning jah kanaki ti cun süm ua.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama likcime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Akpäihnaka dämduhkia a johit cun Bawipaa dä yümmatnak am nami johit ngjuktha yahnak vaia bilo ua. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Khawyaia mhleimhlaknake nami jah sungkham khawh vaia Pamhnam naw a ning jah peta likcim cun jah bilo ua. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Mimi cun naw khyang üng mi ngtuatki am ni, anghmüp k'uma veki Ngmüimkhya ksea johite, anae, jah upkie ja khankhawa veki johite cun mi jah ngtukah püikie ni. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Pamhnama likcime cun atuh jah suiawi u! Khawmhnüp kse a pha law üng yea a ning tukahnak cun na sungkham khawh khai, acun üngva na nglehei cäm lü apäihnak vei cäpa na ngtu khawh khai.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:5">Hesa 11:5</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Hesa 59:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ngthungtak cun khapata kba na kcawi khit lü ngsungpyunnak am na ngkyang khüm lü ngsüngcei lü ngdüia, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Hesa 52:7</ref></char></note>Dimyenaka thangkdaw cän sang khaia yüconaka khawdawk cän ngcum ua. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Khawyaia kah däikia thee cän na jah hnimnak khawh vaia jumeinaka ksawi cän akcün tä se kawt ua. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Hesa 59:17</ref></char></note>Küikyannaka mthi lukhum ja Ngmüimkhya naw a ning jah peta Pamhnama ngthu cän kcimsaüa kba jah taei ua. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Avan cun ktaiyünak am pawh u lü Pamhnama kpüinak pi kthähei ua. Ngmüimkhya naw lam a ning jah msüma kba akcün tä ktaiyü ua. Ahina phäha mcei lü käh ngdüm lü Pamhnama khyangea phäh angläta ktaiyü ua. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Keia phäh pi ktaiyü u bä, Pamhnam naw a na peta ngthu cun ling lü pyen lü ngthupkia thangkdaw cun ka jah ksingsak vaia phäh ni. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Thawng k'uma atuh ve üngpi ahina thangkdawa phäh kei cun ngsäa ka kyaki. Thangkdaw cun ka pyen kung vaia kba ling lü ka pyen vaia ktaiyü ua.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hnuksetnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Ngs 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Tim 4:12</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:21,22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:7">Kol 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>Ihawkba ka veki ti cun nami ksing vaia Bawipaa khut pawhnak am sitihki mpya, mi mhlänaka mi bena Taikikah naw ka mawng ning jah mtheh khai. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Nangmi ngjuktha ning jah pe lü ihawkba kami vekie ti cun ning jah mtheh khaia ani ka tüih law ni.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Pa Pamhnam ja Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw naw khritjanea dimdeihnak ja jumnak am mhläkphyanak ning jah pe se. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Am thi theikia mhläkphyanak am Bawi Jesuh Khritaw kphyanakiea veia Pamhnama bäkhäknak ve se.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
